\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. August to September came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, September to October came in at 56% of normal and January to February at 40%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 144% and June to July at 139%, while January to February sat at 41%.</p>"}
